atar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16175304?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT","html_url":"https://github.com/CaselIT","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-05-21T19:33:54Z","updated_at":"2020-05-21T19:33:54Z","body":"Just checked before and after on windows, without cexts:\r\n\r\nbefore: `test_core_fetchall : Load Core result rows using fetchall. (500000 iterations); total fn calls 13000490` `13000490 function calls (13000477 primitive calls) in 8.752 seconds`\r\nafter: `test_core_fetchall : Load Core result rows using fetchall. (500000 iterations); total fn calls 5500486` `5500486 function calls (5500473 primitive calls) in 4.092 seconds`\r\n👍 ","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/comments/632301758/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"CaselIT","id":16175304,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MTc1MzA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16175304?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT","html_url":"https://github.com/CaselIT","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/comments/632306875","html_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/5340#issuecomment-632306875","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/5340","id":632306875,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDYzMjMwNjg3NQ==","user":{"login":"CaselIT","id":16175304,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MTc1MzA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16175304?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT","html_url":"https://github.com/CaselIT","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-05-21T19:45:41Z","updated_at":"2020-05-21T19:46:09Z","body":"Looking at `row.py` there are some easy wins that let us remove 250k function calls\r\n\r\n`test_core_fetchall : Load Core result rows using fetchall. (500000 iterations); total fn calls 2500486`\r\n`2500486 function calls (2500473 primitive calls) in 3.430 seconds`\r\n\r\n```diff\r\ndiff --git a/lib/sqlalchemy/engine/row.py b/lib/sqlalchemy/engine/row.py\r\nindex d279776ce..2d4045da4 100644\r\n--- a/lib/sqlalchemy/engine/row.py\r\n+++ b/lib/sqlalchemy/engine/row.py\r\n@@ -103,7 +103,7 @@ except ImportError:\r\n         def __getitem__(self, key):\r\n             return self._data[key]\r\n \r\n-        def _subscript_impl(self, key, ismapping):\r\n+        def _subscript_impl(self, key, ismapping=False):\r\n             try:\r\n                 rec = self._keymap[key]\r\n             except KeyError as ke:\r\n@@ -132,8 +132,7 @@ except ImportError:\r\n \r\n             return self._data[mdindex]\r\n \r\n-        def _get_by_key_impl(self, key):\r\n-            return self._subscript_impl(key, False)\r\n+        _get_by_key_impl = _subscript_impl\r\n \r\n         def _get_by_key_impl_mapping(self, key):\r\n             # the C code has two different methods so that we can distinguish\r\n@@ -322,6 +321,13 @@ class Row(BaseRow, collections_abc.Sequence):\r\n         raise NotImplementedError()\r\n \r\n \r\n+def _add_getitem(cls):\r\n+    if not _baserow_usecext:\r\n+        cls.__getitem__ = cls._get_by_key_impl\r\n+    return cls\r\n+\r\n+\r\n+@_add_getitem\r\n class LegacyRow(Row):\r\n     \"\"\"A subclass of :class:`.Row` that delivers 1.x SQLAlchemy behaviors\r\n     for Core.\r\n@@ -347,11 +353,6 @@ class LegacyRow(Row):\r\n     def __contains__(self, key):\r\n         return self._parent._contains(key, self)\r\n \r\n-    if not _baserow_usecext:\r\n-\r\n-        def __getitem__(self, key):\r\n-            return self._get_by_key_impl(key)\r\n-\r\n     @util.deprecated(\r\n         \"1.4\",\r\n         \"The :meth:`.LegacyRow.has_key` method is deprecated and will be \"\r\n@@ -482,6 +483,7 @@ class ROMappingView(\r\n         return list(other) != list(self)\r\n \r\n \r\n+@_add_getitem\r\n class RowMapping(BaseRow, collections_abc.Mapping):\r\n     \"\"\"A ``Mapping`` that maps column names and objects to :class:`.Row` values.\r\n \r\n@@ -510,9 +512,6 @@ class RowMapping(BaseRow, collections_abc.Mapping):\r\n \r\n     if not _baserow_usecext:\r\n \r\n-        def __getitem__(self, key):\r\n-            return self._get_by_key_impl(key)\r\n-\r\n         def _values_impl(self):\r\n             return list(self._data)\r\n ```","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/comments/632306875/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"CaselIT","id":16175304,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MTc1MzA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16175304?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT","html_url":"https://github.com/CaselIT","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/comments/632322809","html_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/5340#issuecomment-632322809","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/5340","id":632322809,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDYzMjMyMjgwOQ==","user":{"login":"CaselIT","id":16175304,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MTc1MzA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16175304?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT","html_url":"https://github.com/CaselIT","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-05-21T20:21:22Z","updated_at":"2020-05-21T20:28:11Z","body":"ok, this is really strange\r\n```\r\nIn [1]: %timeit tuple(i for i in range(10000))\r\n578 µs ± 23.2 µs per loop (mean ± std. dev. of 7 runs, 1000 loops each)\r\nIn [2]: %timeit tuple([i for i in range(10000)])\r\n409 µs ± 14.2 µs per loop (mean ± std. dev. of 7 runs, 1000 loops each)\r\n```\r\n\r\nthis is slower instead\r\n```\r\nIn [4]: %timeit tuple(range(100000))\r\n2.64 ms ± 93.3 µs per loop (mean ± std. dev. of 7 runs, 100 loops each)\r\nIn [3]: %timeit tuple(list(range(100000)))\r\n3.92 ms ± 223 µs per loop (mean ± std. dev. of 7 runs, 100 loops each)\r\n```","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/comments/632322809/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"CaselIT","id":16175304,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MTc1MzA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercont